/**
 * @file MIMO.cnl
 * Test case for linNet.
 *
 * An LC element with two independently injected input voltages serves as
 * a simple MIMO system. Three voltages are calculated and form the system
 * outputs.   
 *
 * In the numeric post-processing, Octave shows a matrix-plot with the
 * step function of every output voltage depending on both inputs (while
 * it assumes the other input to be zero).
 *
 * Copyright (C) 2014-2026 Peter Vranken (mailto:Peter_Vranken@Yahoo.de)
